{"__formatVersion":2,"__revision":"c903f0a379dcf0ac","__entryId":"selection","entry":{"sceneUI":["<div style=\"position:relative;max-width:380px;margin:0 auto;padding:4px 0\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:6px\">把提示词写好的三个习惯</div>\n      <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--text-2)\">写提示词时，先说明目标，再补充必要背景。<span style=\"background:#1a66ff;color:#fff;border-radius:2px;padding:0 2px\">模型只能依据当前提供的信息响应</span>，因此关键约束也要明确写出。</p>\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;left:128px;top:60px;background:var(--inverse-bg);color:var(--inverse-text);font-size:12px;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:6px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float)\">📋 复制</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"background:#1d2129;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8\">\n      <div><span style=\"color:var(--code-muted);display:inline-block;width:16px;margin-right:10px\">1</span><span style=\"color:#7ee787\">.card</span> <span style=\"color:#c9d1d9\">{</span></div>\n      <div><span style=\"color:var(--code-muted);display:inline-block;width:16px;margin-right:10px\">2</span><span style=\"background:rgba(63,140,255,.45);color:#fff;border-radius:2px;padding:0 2px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;border-radius: 12px;</span></div>\n      <div><span style=\"color:var(--code-muted);display:inline-block;width:16px;margin-right:10px\">3</span><span style=\"color:#c9d1d9\">&nbsp;&nbsp;padding:</span> <span style=\"color:#79c0ff\">16px</span><span style=\"color:#c9d1d9\">;</span></div>\n      <div><span style=\"color:var(--code-muted);display:inline-block;width:16px;margin-right:10px\">4</span><span style=\"color:#c9d1d9\">}</span></div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\"><span style=\"background:#8fb4ff;border-radius:2px;padding:0 2px\">保存草稿</span></button>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">✕ 拖动时意外选中按钮文字</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\">保存草稿</button>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--green)\">✓ user-select: none 防误选</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"text-align:center;padding:8px 0\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:3px;color:var(--brand);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px\">MUSEON&nbsp;STUDIO</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);line-height:1.7\">让好想法<span style=\"background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand);border-radius:2px;padding:0 3px\">被世界看见</span></div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:8px\">用 ::selection 统一设置选区配色</div>\n    </div>"],"sceneUI_en":["<div style=\"position:relative;max-width:380px;margin:0 auto;padding:4px 0\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:6px\">Three Habits for Better Prompts</div>\n      <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--text-2)\">When writing a prompt, state your goal first, then give context. <span style=\"background:#1a66ff;color:#fff;border-radius:2px;padding:0 2px\">The model can't read your mind</span>, so list every key constraint clearly instead of expecting it to guess.</p>\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;left:128px;top:60px;background:var(--inverse-bg);color:var(--inverse-text);font-size:12px;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:6px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float)\">📋 Copy</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"background:#1d2129;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8\">\n      <div><span style=\"color:var(--code-muted);display:inline-block;width:16px;margin-right:10px\">1</span><span style=\"color:#7ee787\">.card</span> <span style=\"color:#c9d1d9\">{</span></div>\n      <div><span style=\"color:var(--code-muted);display:inline-block;width:16px;margin-right:10px\">2</span><span style=\"background:rgba(63,140,255,.45);color:#fff;border-radius:2px;padding:0 2px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;border-radius: 12px;</span></div>\n      <div><span style=\"color:var(--code-muted);display:inline-block;width:16px;margin-right:10px\">3</span><span style=\"color:#c9d1d9\">&nbsp;&nbsp;padding:</span> <span style=\"color:#79c0ff\">16px</span><span style=\"color:#c9d1d9\">;</span></div>\n      <div><span style=\"color:var(--code-muted);display:inline-block;width:16px;margin-right:10px\">4</span><span style=\"color:#c9d1d9\">}</span></div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\"><span style=\"background:#8fb4ff;border-radius:2px;padding:0 2px\">Save Draft</span></button>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">✕ Meant to click, dragged a blue streak</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\">Save Draft</button>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--green)\">✓ user-select: none prevents mis-selection</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"text-align:center;padding:8px 0\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:3px;color:var(--brand);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px\">MUSEON&nbsp;STUDIO</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);line-height:1.7\">Let good ideas <span style=\"background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand);border-radius:2px;padding:0 3px\">be seen by the world</span></div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:8px\">Selection color = brand color, one line of ::selection</div>\n    </div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"text\"><span class=\"sel-anat-line\">前面这段没选中，<span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"range\"><span class=\"sel-anat-range\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"bg\"><span class=\"sel-anat-bg\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"fg\"><span class=\"sel-anat-fg\">这段被拖选</span></span></span></span></span></span>，后面也没选中</span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"text\"><span class=\"sel-anat-line\">The previous paragraph is not selected, <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"range\"><span class=\"sel-anat-range\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"bg\"><span class=\"sel-anat-bg\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"fg\"><span class=\"sel-anat-fg\">This paragraph was dragged and selected</span></span></span></span></span></span>, and the rest was not selected</span></span>","parts":[{"key":"text","cn":"普通文本","en":"Text","desc":"没被选中的部分，保持原样","desc_en":"The unselected part stays exactly as it was"},{"key":"range","cn":"选区","en":"Selection","desc":"鼠标拖选覆盖的那一段范围","desc_en":"The span of text covered by the mouse drag"},{"key":"bg","cn":"高亮底色","en":"Background","desc":"::selection 的 background","desc_en":"The background of ::selection"},{"key":"fg","cn":"高亮文字色","en":"Color","desc":"::selection 的 color，和底色对比要够","desc_en":"The color of ::selection; must contrast enough with the background"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"默认","en":"Default","demo":"<span class=\"sel-v\"><mark class=\"sel-mk-default\">选中高亮</mark></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"sel-v\"><mark class=\"sel-mk-default\">Selection</mark></span>","when":"没有品牌化需求时保留浏览器默认样式","when_en":"When the browser default already meets the product's needs"},{"cn":"品牌色","en":"Brand","demo":"<span class=\"sel-v\"><mark class=\"sel-mk-brand\">选中高亮</mark></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"sel-v\"><mark class=\"sel-mk-brand\">Selection</mark></span>","when":"不用新增组件，选中状态就能呼应品牌色","when_en":"Echoes your brand color without new components"},{"cn":"防误选","en":"NoSelect","demo":"<span class=\"sel-v-none\">拖拽手柄 · user-select: none</span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"sel-v-none\">Drag handle · user-select: none</span>","when":"确实不应被选中的拖拽手柄或纯交互装饰","when_en":"Drag handles or interaction-only decoration that should not be selected"}],"use":[{"t":"没有品牌化需求时，浏览器默认选中样式通常已经清楚可见","m":"sel-default"},{"t":"换成<b>品牌色</b>呼应：可在合适的作用域用 ::selection 定义；全局规则会影响所有可选文本，先确认范围","m":"sel-brand"},{"t":"定制时<b>保证对比度</b>：深底配白字，浅底配深字","m":"sel-contrast"},{"t":"拖拽手柄等纯交互元素可加 <b>user-select: none</b>：防误选","m":"sel-none"}],"dont":[{"t":"选中色<b>对比度过低</b>：用户难以识别选中内容","m":"sel-light","bad":true},{"t":"拖动按钮等<b>纯操作元素时意外选中文字</b>：可在明确范围内防止误选","m":"sel-accident","bad":true},{"t":"一个页面使用<b>多种选中色</b>：会削弱选中状态的一致性","m":"sel-rainbow","bad":true},{"t":"给<b>正文</b>设置 user-select: none，会阻止用户选中和复制内容","m":"sel-no-copy","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"文章选中文字后，品牌蓝背景和灰色文字几乎融在一起；团队还想禁止正文复制。怎样调整？","options":[{"id":"readable-scoped-selection","label":"为正文设置高对比选区颜色并允许复制，只在拖拽手柄等区域禁选","feedback":"选区必须清楚可见，正文复制是正常能力；禁选应限制在确实会误触的操作区域。","correct":true},{"id":"brand-color-only","label":"保留品牌蓝和灰字，只要色彩符合品牌规范就不再调整","feedback":"品牌一致不能替代选区可读性，低对比会让用户无法确认自己选中了什么。","correct":false},{"id":"disable-article-selection","label":"给整篇正文设置 user-select: none，彻底避免误选","feedback":"正文并非拖拽控件，全面禁选会阻止复制、引用和辅助阅读等正常任务。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"Selected article text uses brand blue behind gray copy and is barely readable, and the team wants to block copying. What should change?","options":[{"id":"readable-scoped-selection","label":"Use a high-contrast selection for body text, allow copying, and disable selection only on drag handles","feedback":"Selection must remain visible and body copying is normal; prevention belongs only where selection interferes with an operation.","correct":true},{"id":"brand-color-only","label":"Keep the brand blue and gray text because brand compliance is more important","feedback":"Brand consistency cannot replace selection readability; low contrast hides what users selected.","correct":false},{"id":"disable-article-selection","label":"Apply user-select: none to the entire article so accidental selection cannot happen","feedback":"Body copy is not a drag control, and global prevention blocks copying, quoting, and assistive reading tasks.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"请把正文 ::selection 调整为在浅色和深色主题都清楚可读的品牌配色，正文继续允许选择和复制。user-select: none 只用于拖拽手柄等明确操作区，并验证键盘复制与选区范围。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Use brand-aligned ::selection colors that remain readable in light and dark themes, and keep body text selectable and copyable. Restrict user-select: none to explicit drag handles, then verify keyboard copy and selection scope."}},"references":[{"title":"::selection 伪元素","source":"MDN","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/::selection","title_en":"::selection"},{"title":"user-select 属性","source":"MDN","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/user-select","title_en":"user-select"}],"scenes":["文章正文选中复制","代码片段选中","按钮拖拽防误选","品牌官网的文本选中"],"en":{"use":[{"t":"Highlight selected text","m":"sel-default"},{"t":"Choose rows for a bulk action","m":"sel-brand"},{"t":"Select files or canvas objects","m":"sel-contrast"},{"t":"Keep a current item visibly chosen","m":"sel-none"}],"dont":[{"t":"Use the same style for hover, focus, and selection","m":"sel-light","bad":true},{"t":"Clear a multi-selection without warning","m":"sel-accident","bad":true},{"t":"Show a selected appearance before the data is selected","m":"sel-rainbow","bad":true},{"t":"Rely on color alone for important item selection","m":"sel-no-copy","bad":true}],"scenes":["Text selection","Table rows","File browser","Design canvas"],"sceneUI":["<div style=\"position:relative;max-width:380px;margin:0 auto;padding:4px 0\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:6px\">Three Habits for Better Prompts</div>\n      <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--text-2)\">When writing a prompt, state your goal first, then give context. <span style=\"background:#1a66ff;color:#fff;border-radius:2px;padding:0 2px\">The model can't read your mind</span>, so list every key constraint clearly instead of expecting it to guess.</p>\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;left:128px;top:60px;background:var(--inverse-bg);color:var(--inverse-text);font-size:12px;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:6px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float)\">📋 Copy</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"background:#1d2129;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8\">\n      <div><span style=\"color:var(--code-muted);display:inline-block;width:16px;margin-right:10px\">1</span><span style=\"color:#7ee787\">.card</span> <span style=\"color:#c9d1d9\">{</span></div>\n      <div><span style=\"color:var(--code-muted);display:inline-block;width:16px;margin-right:10px\">2</span><span style=\"background:rgba(63,140,255,.45);color:#fff;border-radius:2px;padding:0 2px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;border-radius: 12px;</span></div>\n      <div><span style=\"color:var(--code-muted);display:inline-block;width:16px;margin-right:10px\">3</span><span style=\"color:#c9d1d9\">&nbsp;&nbsp;padding:</span> <span style=\"color:#79c0ff\">16px</span><span style=\"color:#c9d1d9\">;</span></div>\n      <div><span style=\"color:var(--code-muted);display:inline-block;width:16px;margin-right:10px\">4</span><span style=\"color:#c9d1d9\">}</span></div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\"><span style=\"background:#8fb4ff;border-radius:2px;padding:0 2px\">Save Draft</span></button>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">✕ Meant to click, dragged a blue streak</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\">Save Draft</button>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--green)\">✓ user-select: none prevents mis-selection</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"text-align:center;padding:8px 0\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:3px;color:var(--brand);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px\">MUSEON&nbsp;STUDIO</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);line-height:1.7\">Let good ideas <span style=\"background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand);border-radius:2px;padding:0 3px\">be seen by the world</span></div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:8px\">Selection color = brand color, one line of ::selection</div>\n    </div>"]},"usageMocks":{"sel-default":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);line-height:1.7;text-align:left\">拖选一段文字，<span style=\"background:#1a66ff;color:#fff;border-radius:2px;padding:0 2px\">这一段被选中了</span>，颜色由浏览器和系统决定。</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">默认样式通常已经能清楚表达选中状态</span>","sel-brand":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);line-height:1.7;text-align:left\">同一段话，<span style=\"background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand);border-radius:2px;padding:0 2px\">选中色换成品牌色</span>，先确认对比度与作用范围。</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">全局 ::selection 会影响全站；也可按组件范围定义</span>","sel-contrast":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"background:#3559d8;color:#fff;font-size:12px;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:3px\">深底白字 ✓</span><span style=\"background:#ffe9a8;color:#30343c;font-size:12px;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:3px\">浅底深字 ✓</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">选中背景与文字需要保持清楚对比</span>","sel-none":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-btn primary\">保存</span><span style=\"width:24px;height:18px;background:var(--brand-light);border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:3px\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">user-select: none</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">按钮、图片防止被误选</span>","sel-light":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);line-height:1.7;text-align:left\">这段话中<span style=\"background:var(--bg-hover);border-radius:2px;padding:0 2px\">有一部分被选中</span>，但状态不明显。</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">选中颜色过浅，用户难以识别范围</span>","sel-accident":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"background:#1a66ff;color:#fff;font-size:12px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px\">按钮文字被选中</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">拖动点击区域时意外选中了按钮文字</span></div>","sel-rainbow":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"background:#1a66ff;color:#fff;font-size:12px;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:2px\">选区</span><span style=\"background:var(--red);color:var(--on-status);font-size:12px;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:2px\">选区</span><span style=\"background:#287947;color:#fff;font-size:12px;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:2px\">选区</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">同页选中色不一致，降低界面一致性</span>","sel-no-copy":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);line-height:1.7;text-align:left\">正文设置了 user-select: none，用户无法选中并复制需要的内容。</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">防误选规则不应覆盖正文</span>"}}}